Z||000001||rogergarrison||04-11-2001||07:31 PM||||You can glue on a block of styrofoam on the header supprt or bottom/inside of cover. You can carve it to shape with a knife and some #36 sandpaper. Ive done that to Dodge Daytona and Corvettes.||||reg||1
